:: Bloomshore Hallway
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-hallway", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You are in the upstairs hallway. Four doors line the corridor; the attic hatch waits above, and the stairs lead down.

<<icon "bedroom">><<link "Enter your bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Bedroom">><</link>>
<<icon "bedroom">><<link `"Enter " + LoveInterests.displayName("caleb") + "'s bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>"`>><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Caleb Bedroom">><</link>>
<<icon "bedroom">><<link "Enter Grandma's bedroom <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Grandma Bedroom">><</link>>
<<icon "apartment-door">><<link "Try the locked room <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Locked Room">><</link>>
<<gap>>
<<actionIcon "stairs-up">><<link "Go up to the attic <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Attic Locked">><</link>>
<<actionIcon "stairs-down">><<link "Go downstairs <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Downstairs">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Caleb Bedroom
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<pronouns "caleb">>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-caleb-bedroom", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You stand in <<Caleb>>'s bedroom. His room is spotless, save for the cluster of paper airplanes that lay scattered across his desk.

<<icon "apartment-hall">><<link "Return to the hallway <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Hallway">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Grandma Bedroom
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-grandma-bedroom", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You stand in Grandma's bedroom. Soft light filters through her lace curtains. You catch a whiff of her old perfume and hairspray; Seems she is gone for now.

<<icon "apartment-hall">><<link "Return to the hallway <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Bloomshore Hallway">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Locked Room
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-hallway", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You try the door. It's locked.

<<link "Step back">><<goto "Bloomshore Hallway">><</link>>

:: Bloomshore Attic Locked
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !Player.isYounger()>><<goto "Bloomshore District">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("bloomshore-hallway", "Bloomshore District — Home")>>\
You reach for the attic hatch, only to find it's locked. <<warning>>It's not like you'd want to go up there anyways, given what happened to you when you were younger.<</warning>>

<<link "Step back">><<goto "Bloomshore Hallway">><</link>>
